%% HANDWRITTEN. Checked against D120 + D121 + api/routers/agent.py + services/assist/service.py
%% + apps/workstation/src/assist.tsx + apps/customer_assist/index.html
%% One round trip: the broker stops describing a website and fills it instead.
%% REWRITTEN 2026-09-08 for D121. The previous version drew `push form -> 400`, which was
%% D120's KIND-based gate and is now wrong in both directions: a blank quote form reaches a
%% guest screen, and the personal one never gets as far as a 400 because the control is
%% disabled with its reason.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as ลูกค้า · customer
    participant P as customer_assist<br/>(one static page, polls 1s)
    participant API as ReadyCall API
    participant W as workstation<br/>(React, socket)
    actor B as นายหน้า · broker

    Note over C,B: they are already on a call. The brief is on the broker's screen.

    B->>W: presses สร้างลิงก์ให้ลูกค้า
    W->>API: POST /v1/agent/calls/{id}/assist/link
    API-->>W: token + link (idempotent per call)
    Note over W: SMS / LINE picker. LINE is DISABLED with its reason:<br/>its API needs a user id, not a phone number
    B-->>C: reads the link out<br/>(nothing is sent — NotifierPort is P5)

    C->>P: taps the link
    P->>API: GET /v1/assist/{token}
    API-->>P: tier=guest · call_active=true
    Note over P: the header says กำลังสนทนากับเจ้าหน้าที่<br/>so the page never looks like a stray form

    B->>W: opens กล่องเครื่องมือ
    W->>API: GET /v1/agent/assist/tools
    API-->>W: 11 tools in 4 groups, each with `personal`
    Note over W: the 5 personal tools render DISABLED with the reason.<br/>Greying is the courtesy. The server refuses independently

    B->>API: push compare.plans (personal=false)
    P->>API: (next poll, ≤1s)
    API-->>P: the comparison

    B->>API: push form.quote_request (personal=false)
    API-->>P: a FORM, on a screen with no account
    Note over C,P: D121: a blank quote request is true for anybody.<br/>Gating it on `kind: form` walled off the one part<br/>of the journey with no privacy cost at all
    C->>P: fills it in and submits
    P->>API: POST /v1/assist/{token}/respond
    W->>API: GET /v1/agent/calls/{id}/assist
    API-->>W: responded=true + exactly what they typed

    B-->>C: asks them to sign in, to go further
    C->>P: signs in
    P->>API: POST /v1/assist/{token}/sign-in
    API-->>P: tier=verified
    Note over W: the 5 locked tools become pressable

    B->>API: push form.claim_notify (personal=true)
    API->>API: prefill from the FROZEN snapshot<br/>policy_no · insurer · holder_name
    API-->>P: the form, already filled in
    C->>P: types the rest and submits
    Note over B: nobody read a field name down a phone line
